Subject: [PATCH 115/121] DT1: one-kernel chain tree build at topk=1
 (SGLANG_OPT_DRAFT_TAIL)

Under SGLANG_OPT_DRAFT_TAIL, topk=1, CUDA, FULL_MASK or QLEN_ONLY bool mask:
build_tree_kernel_efficient builds the chain tree (positions, retrieve
index/next/sibling, verify tokens, mask cells) with one Triton kernel instead
of torch.cat + retrieve torch.full + build_tree_efficient. The prefix mask fill
is unchanged. Bit-exact vs the sgl_kernel path (84 GPU cases); epilogue
-4.8 / -8.1..-8.6 / -21.2..-29.0 us per step at 3 / 7 / 15 draft steps.

Also: inventory entry for build_chain_tree_topk1, black line fix in the
draft-extend select finalize kernel.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
